This product includes software developed by the FerretDB project
(https://www.ferretdb.com), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The initial wire protocol, client connection, handler, type system, and utility
packages were adapted from FerretDB:

  Repository: https://github.com/FerretDB/FerretDB
  Commit:     799235dab9e350655e72e65a0b24d849f7d68143

All import paths have been updated from github.com/FerretDB/FerretDB to
github.com/dolthub/dumbodb, and the storage backend has been replaced with a
Dolt-native implementation.

This product also uses Dolt (https://github.com/dolthub/dolt), a version-controlled
SQL database, as its storage engine.

